            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA akongera yangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, cwa omusango, gira ocwere omusango orubuga orunyakuseesa esagama nubwo orumanyise ebintu ebibi byona ebi rwakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orugambire oti: MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Rubuga iwe, orunyakuseesa esagama hagati yarwo; kandi orunyakwekorra ebisisani eby'okwesiisa, ngu akasumi kaarwo kahikire! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oina omusango ogw'esagama ei waseesire, kandi okeesiisa n'ebisisani ebi wakozire; ekiro kyawe okakiiriza haihi, akasumi ak'emyaka yawe akaatairweho kahikire nikyo nkufooliire kintu eky'okujumwa amahanga, kandi eky'okugaywa ensi yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abanyakukuli haihi n'abanyakukuli hara, nibaija kukusekeereza iwe omubi, kandi anyakurumu obwogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
